      <meta name="Description" content="Offering more than 100 certificate, associate and bachelor’s degree programs, Daytona State College is the premier education and workforce training institution in Volusia and Flagler counties, Central Florida and beyond. Graduates serve in critical fields including healthcare, emergency services, business, education, hospitality, engineering, technology, aerospace and more. Daytona State is recognized as a leader in higher education by U.S. News &amp; World Report. DSC ranks among the top 50 most affordable public four-year institutions in the country, with less than half the tuition of the national average.">
      <meta name="Keywords" content="daytona state college, 1-year programs, certificate programs, 2-year programs, associate of arts degree, associate of science degree, 4-year degree, bachelor's degree, baccalaureate, top online programs, technology, business, culinary, hospitality, photography, healthcare, health care, nursing, public service, veteran, veterans, GI bill, cultural, arts, general education, higher education, dsc, falcons, login, daytona login, daytona state login, daytona state college login, daytonastate, mydaytonastate">
