         <main id="main" class="mt-16 md:mt-20">
            <section xmlns:array="http://www.w3.org/2005/xpath-functions/array" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" class="relative pt-16 md:pt-20 px-1/24 pb-1/24 first:-mt-16 md:first:-mt-20 bg-blue-navy"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" src="/_resources/images/background.jpg" class="adhere object-cover object-top"><div class="adhere gradient-hero-bg"></div>
               <div class="relative flex min-h-screen-75 md:min-h-500 lg:min-h-600 items-end p-1/22 text-white bg-blue-navy">
                  <video-cover video-url="/files/video/hero-video-4.mp4">
                     <div class="adhere gradient-hero"></div>
                     <video-cover-button class="absolute right-1 bottom-1 w-9 h-9 p-3 bg-blue-navy bg-opacity-50"></video-cover-button>
                  </video-cover>
                  <div class="relative mr-6">
                     <h1 class="title-xxl relative">Daytona State College<span class="absolute top-8 lg:top-16 right-full block w-1/4 h-1.5 mr-2 lg:mr-5 bg-orange"></span></h1>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </section>
            	
            	
            <section class="background-white feature-story--image-left">
               		
               <div class="container">
                  			
                  <div class="feature-story__inner md:flex justify-center items-center">
                     				
                     				
                     <div class="relative md:w-9/22 2xl:w-8/22 self-stretch h-96 md:h-auto md:min-h-80">
                        					<img src="/images/womens-soccer-promo.jpg" alt="A Falcon student-athlete throwing the ball into play during a women's soccer match. " class="adhere object-cover">
                        				</div>
                     				
                     <div class="md:w-11/22 2xl:w-9/22 md:mx-1/22 mt-8 md:mt-0">
                        					
                        <h2 class="title-md">You Belong Here!</h2>
                        					
                        					
                        <div class="mt-6 lg:mt-8 md:pl-8 lg:pl-10">
                           						
                           <div class="rich-text">
                              <p class="sc-BodyText" tabindex="-1"><span tabindex="-1">Offering more than 100 certificate, associate and bachelor’s degree programs,&nbsp;<strong tabindex="-1">Daytona State is the premier source</strong>&nbsp;for education and advanced training in&nbsp;<strong tabindex="-1">Central Florida</strong>.</span></p>
                              
                              <p class="sc-BodyText" tabindex="-1">The College enrolls approximately 23,000 students a year at its seven instructional
                                 sites, with graduates serving in critical fields, including healthcare, emergency
                                 services, business, education, hospitality, engineering technology, aeronautics, computer
                                 science, and more.</p>
                              
                              <p class="sc-BodyText" tabindex="-1">Whether you know exactly what you want to do, or are still undecided, the program
                                 finder is a great place to start. You belong here!</p>
                           </div>
                           						
                           <div class="mt-4">
                              							<a class="hover-highlight py-0.5 font-semibold text-18 leading-160" href="/program-finder/index.html" target="_self">
                                 								Explore the Program Finder
                                 
                                 								<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block w-6 h-6 mb-1 ml-2 text-red">
                                    									
                                    <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/_resources/images/symbol.svg#arrow"/>
                                    								</svg>
                                 							</a>
                              						</div>
                           					</div>
                        				</div>
                     			</div>
                  		</div>
               	</section>
            
             
            
            
            <section class="background-blue">
               <div class="container">
                  <div class="md:px-1/22 lg:px-3/22 xl:px-5/22">
                     
                     <div xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" class="rich-text">
                        <h2>Start your journey at Daytona State College</h2>
                        	
                        	
                        	
                        	
                        	
                        <ul class="flex justify-between flex-wrap my-8 md:my-10">
                           		
                           <li class="block w-full md:w-23/48 -mt-0.5 border-t-2 border-b-2 border-blue-ash">
                              			<a href="https://daytonastate.my.salesforce-sites.com/inquiry/TargetX_Base__InquiryForm#?formId=a0B8a00000zvJcwEAE&amp;formType=general" class="flex justify-between items-center h-full py-4 font-semibold text-20 md:text-24 tracking-slight leading-110" target="_blank">
                                 				<span class="hover-highlight">Request More Information</span>
                                 
                                 				
                                 <div class="cta-icon w-8 h-8 ml-3 flex-shrink-0">
                                    					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="adhere text-red">
                                       						
                                       <use xlink:href="/_resources/images/symbol.svg#arrow-circle"/>
                                       					</svg>
                                    
                                    					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="cta-icon__front adhere text-blue-navy">
                                       						
                                       <use xlink:href="/_resources/images/symbol.svg#arrow-circle"/>
                                       					</svg>
                                    				</div>
                                 			</a>
                              		</li>
                           	</ul>
                        
                        <p>Complete this short program interest form to learn more about Daytona State's academic
                           programs and degrees.&nbsp;</p>
                        <hr>
                     </div>
                     </div>
               </div>
            </section>
            
            	
            	
            <section class="background-blue overflow-hidden">
               		
               <carousel-cards title="Falcon Updates">
                  		<a class="card bg-white w-full md:w-card mr-10 flex-shrink-0" href="/in-the-community/the-arts/index.html" target="_self">
                     			
                     <div class="relative w-full h-80 2xl:h-96 bg-blue-ash overflow-hidden">
                        				<img class="filter__image adhere object-cover pointer-events-none" src="/in-the-community/the-arts/images/winter-wonderettes-holidazzle.jpg" alt="DSC Presents Holidazzle: Winter Wonderettes, with an illustrated graphic showing snow and 1960's era microphones. ">
                        			</div>
                     			
                     <div class="p-8 md:p-10">
                        				
                        <h3 class="title-sm mb-5">Enjoy the Holidays with Holidazzle: Winter Wonderettes</h3>
                        				
                        <div class="rich-text">
                           <p><strong>Celebrate the season at Daytona State College's News-Journal Center with a holiday
                                 feast, live singers, and Winter Wonderettes, a festive musical featuring '60s holiday
                                 classics.</strong><br><br><strong>Holidazzle Holiday Dinner &amp; Show - 1 Night Only!</strong><br>Friday, December 11 at 6 p.m.<br>Cash Bar Available<br>Tickets: $50 Adults ($25 Children 12 &amp; Under)<br><br><strong>Show Only</strong><br>Saturday, December 12 at 1 p.m.<br>Sunday, December 13 at 2 p.m.<br>Tickets: $10 Adults, $5 Children, $5 Volusia &amp; Flagler County Students<br>Free admission for DSC students, faculty, and staff with a valid DSC ID.</p>
                           
                           <p>&nbsp;</p>
                        </div>
                        				
                        <div class="font-semibold text-18 leading-140">
                           					<span class="hover-highlight-child">
                              						Get your Holidazzle tickets here. 
                              
                              						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block w-6 h-6 mb-1 ml-2 text-red">
                                 							
                                 <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/_resources/images/symbol.svg#arrow"/>
                                 						</svg>
                              					</span>
                           				</div>
                        			</div>
                     		</a>
                  		<a class="card bg-white w-full md:w-card mr-10 flex-shrink-0" href="/news-and-events/news-releases/2026-news-release/national-call-to-action.html" target="_self">
                     			
                     <div class="relative w-full h-80 2xl:h-96 bg-blue-ash overflow-hidden">
                        				<img class="filter__image adhere object-cover pointer-events-none" src="/images/national-call-to-action.jpg" alt="A National Call to Action: Daytona State College's Commitment">
                        			</div>
                     			
                     <div class="p-8 md:p-10">
                        				
                        <h3 class="title-sm mb-5">Daytona State College's Commitment to Academic Excellence, Student Opportunity and
                           Public Accountability</h3>
                        				
                        <div class="rich-text">
                           <p>Daytona State College, founded with innovation at its core and within a culture of
                              continuous improvement, provides opportunities with educational programs that transform
                              students’ lives and communities we serve. We take pride as an outstanding leader in
                              the Florida College System and as a dynamic, nationally recognized institution known
                              for quality, affordable and in-demand programs.<br>&nbsp;</p>
                        </div>
                        				
                        <div class="font-semibold text-18 leading-140">
                           					<span class="hover-highlight-child">
                              						Read more. 
                              
                              						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block w-6 h-6 mb-1 ml-2 text-red">
                                 							
                                 <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/_resources/images/symbol.svg#arrow"/>
                                 						</svg>
                              					</span>
                           				</div>
                        			</div>
                     		</a>
                  		<a class="card bg-white w-full md:w-card mr-10 flex-shrink-0" href="/academic-departments/college-of-business-engineering-and-technology/school-of-aeronautical-sciences/aerospace-technology-as.html" target="_self">
                     			
                     <div class="relative w-full h-80 2xl:h-96 bg-blue-ash overflow-hidden">
                        				<img class="filter__image adhere object-cover pointer-events-none" src="/academic-departments/college-of-business-engineering-and-technology/school-of-engineering-technology/images/aerospace/blue-origin.jpg" alt="Blue Origin rocket taking off. ">
                        			</div>
                     			
                     <div class="p-8 md:p-10">
                        				
                        <h3 class="title-sm mb-5">Enroll now for the Associate of Science degree in Aerospace Technology</h3>
                        				
                        <div class="rich-text">
                           <p><strong>Daytona State College's Associate of Science in Aerospace Technology degree was developed
                                 in collaboration with NASA, Blue Origin, Northrop Grumman and other aerospace industry
                                 leaders. Applications are being accepted now.&nbsp;</strong></p>
                           
                           <p>The four-semester program provides hands-on training in aircraft structure fabrication
                              using advanced composite materials, along with instruction in building and testing
                              mechanical systems, wiring and troubleshooting electrical circuits and working with
                              analog and digital devices and electronics assembly.</p>
                           
                           <p>Students will also study industrial safety protocols, quality assurance practices
                              and project management.</p>
                        </div>
                        				
                        <div class="font-semibold text-18 leading-140">
                           					<span class="hover-highlight-child">
                              						Learn more here. 
                              
                              						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block w-6 h-6 mb-1 ml-2 text-red">
                                 							
                                 <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/_resources/images/symbol.svg#arrow"/>
                                 						</svg>
                              					</span>
                           				</div>
                        			</div>
                     		</a>
                  		<a class="card bg-white w-full md:w-card mr-10 flex-shrink-0" href="/academic-departments/college-of-health-and-public-services/school-of-health-careers/radiologic-and-imaging-sciences-bs-degree.html" target="_self">
                     			
                     <div class="relative w-full h-80 2xl:h-96 bg-blue-ash overflow-hidden">
                        				<img class="filter__image adhere object-cover pointer-events-none" src="/academic-departments/college-of-health-and-public-services/school-of-health-careers/images/radiologic-imaging-science/mri-radiologic-imaging-sciences.jpg" alt="Two people with an MRI machine. ">
                        			</div>
                     			
                     <div class="p-8 md:p-10">
                        				
                        <h3 class="title-sm mb-5">New Bachelor of Science degree in Radiologic and Imaging Sciences</h3>
                        				
                        <div class="rich-text">
                           <p><strong>Enroll now for the new Bachelor of Science in Radiologic and Imaging Sciences (BSRIS)
                                 at Daytona State College. This degree expands the professional opportunities available
                                 to credentialed imaging technologists</strong>. <br><br>This upper-division program builds upon existing clinical experience and foundational
                              knowledge to prepare imaging professionals for leadership positions and advanced post-primary
                              certification in Computed Tomography (CT). &nbsp;<br><br>Designed for working radiographers, nuclear medicine technologists, radiation therapists,
                              and sonographers, the BSRIS program provides a flexible, affordable pathway to professional
                              growth.&nbsp;<br><br>Our students will graduate with the skills to step into supervisory and leadership
                              roles within imaging departments and healthcare organizations.</p>
                           
                           <p>&nbsp;</p>
                        </div>
                        				
                        <div class="font-semibold text-18 leading-140">
                           					<span class="hover-highlight-child">
                              						Learn more here.
                              
                              						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block w-6 h-6 mb-1 ml-2 text-red">
                                 							
                                 <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/_resources/images/symbol.svg#arrow"/>
                                 						</svg>
                              					</span>
                           				</div>
                        			</div>
                     		</a>
                  		<a class="card bg-white w-full md:w-card mr-10 flex-shrink-0" href="/on-campus/housing/housing-2nd-phase.html" target="_self">
                     			
                     <div class="relative w-full h-80 2xl:h-96 bg-blue-ash overflow-hidden">
                        				<img class="filter__image adhere object-cover pointer-events-none" src="/on-campus/housing/images/res-hall-2-aerial-rendering.jpg" alt="Residence Hall 2 rendering">
                        			</div>
                     			
                     <div class="p-8 md:p-10">
                        				
                        <h3 class="title-sm mb-5">We Need Your Support!</h3>
                        				
                        <div class="rich-text">
                           <p>Our first Residence Hall on the Daytona Beach Campus has been a resounding success
                              since opening in Fall 2022. It is home to 256 students, has been at full capacity
                              since its first day of operation, and applications exceed bed space by more than 300%!</p>
                           
                           <p>Students who live on campus are more engaged with instructors, make more use of academic
                              support services, participate in more on-campus activities, connect socially with
                              peers, and build lifelong friendships that help them navigate financial and personal
                              challenges that help them succeed far better in college and in life.</p>
                           
                           <p>To meet this demand, we are embarking on the most ambitious private fundraising endeavor
                              in the College’s history.<strong> And we need your help!</strong> We’ve set an ambitious goal to raise $16 million to build a second student Residence
                              Hall.<br><br></p>
                        </div>
                        				
                        <div class="font-semibold text-18 leading-140">
                           					<span class="hover-highlight-child">
                              						Learn more
                              
                              						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block w-6 h-6 mb-1 ml-2 text-red">
                                 							
                                 <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/_resources/images/symbol.svg#arrow"/>
                                 						</svg>
                              					</span>
                           				</div>
                        			</div>
                     		</a>
                  		</carousel-cards>
               	</section>
            
            	
            	
            <section class="background-white">
               		
               <div class="container">
                  			
                  <div class="border-b-2 border-blue-ash pb-2">
                     				
                     <h2 class="meta-sm text-blue-gray">By the Numbers</h2>
                     			</div>
                  			
                  <div class="md:flex mt-5 md:space-x-10 lg:space-x-16 xl:space-x-24 2xl:space-x-28">
                     				
                     <div class="md:flex-1 mb-8 last:mb-0 md:mb-0">
                        					<span class="block mb-2 lg:mb-3 font-display text-50 lg:text-100 leading-1 tracking-slight font-semibold">1st</span>
                        					
                        <p class="body-lg">For the 14th straight year, U.S. News &amp; World Report ranks Daytona State College’s
                           Online Bachelor’s Programs among the best in the nation. And DSC is again the top-ranked
                           non-university college in the United States!</p>
                        				</div>
                     				
                     <div class="md:flex-1 mb-8 last:mb-0 md:mb-0">
                        					<span class="block mb-2 lg:mb-3 font-display text-50 lg:text-100 leading-1 tracking-slight font-semibold">50</span>
                        					
                        <p class="body-lg">Our students have expanded opportunities to learn outside the classroom with more
                           than 50 student clubs and organizations to choose from.</p>
                        				</div>
                     				
                     <div class="md:flex-1 mb-8 last:mb-0 md:mb-0">
                        					<span class="block mb-2 lg:mb-3 font-display text-50 lg:text-100 leading-1 tracking-slight font-semibold">1/2</span>
                        					
                        <p class="body-lg">We're half the tuition of state universities - our associate of arts degree is your
                           gateway to a bachelor’s degree at DSC or a 4-year university. </p>
                        				</div>
                     			</div>
                  		</div>
               	</section>
            
            	
            	
            <div class="relative py-3/22">
               		<img src="/images/dsc-front-sign.jpg" class="adhere object-cover pointer-events-none" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
               		
